---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site, legal } from '../../config';

const siteUrl = Astro.site?.origin ?? '';
---

<Layout
  lang="en"
  title={`Legal Notice · ${site.name}`}
  description="Legal Notice under the Spanish LSSI-CE (Law 34/2002) — identifying details of the website operator."
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 sm:py-16 lg:px-12 lg:py-24">
    <p class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-clay sm:text-xs sm:tracking-[0.28em]">
      Legal information
    </p>
    <h1
      class="mt-4 font-display text-3xl leading-[1.1] text-ink sm:mt-6 sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl text-balance"
      style="font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 144, 'SOFT' 50;"
    >
      Legal Notice
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-taupe sm:text-base">
      In compliance with Article 10 of Spanish Law 34/2002 of 11 July, on
      Information Society Services and Electronic Commerce (LSSI-CE), the
      following identifying details are provided.
    </p>

    <div class="prose-legal mt-10 space-y-10 sm:mt-12 sm:space-y-12">
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink sm:text-3xl" style="font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 72;">
          1. Operator details
        </h2>
        <dl class="mt-5 divide-y divide-line border-y border-line">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-1 py-4 sm:grid-cols-[180px_1fr] sm:gap-4">
            <dt class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-taupe">Owner</dt>
            <dd class="text-base text-ink-soft">{legal.titular}</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-1 py-4 sm:grid-cols-[180px_1fr] sm:gap-4">
            <dt class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-taupe">Activity</dt>
            <dd class="text-base text-ink-soft">Coach & Mentor (self-employed)</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-1 py-4 sm:grid-cols-[180px_1fr] sm:gap-4">
            <dt class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-taupe">NIE / NIF</dt>
            <dd class="text-base text-ink-soft">{legal.nif}</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-1 py-4 sm:grid-cols-[180px_1fr] sm:gap-4">
            <dt class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-taupe">Address</dt>
            <dd class="text-base text-ink-soft">{legal.direccion}</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-1 py-4 sm:grid-cols-[180px_1fr] sm:gap-4">
            <dt class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-taupe">Email</dt>
            <dd class="text-base text-ink-soft">
              <a href={`mailto:${legal.email}`} class="underline decoration-line underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-clay">
                {legal.email}
              </a>
            </dd>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-1 py-4 sm:grid-cols-[180px_1fr] sm:gap-4">
            <dt class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-taupe">Phone</dt>
            <dd class="text-base text-ink-soft">{legal.telefono}</dd>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-1 py-4 sm:grid-cols-[180px_1fr] sm:gap-4">
            <dt class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-taupe">Website</dt>
            <dd class="text-base text-ink-soft">{siteUrl}</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink sm:text-3xl" style="font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 72;">
          2. Purpose and scope
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          This Legal Notice governs the use of the website {siteUrl}
          (hereinafter, "the Website"), owned by {legal.titular}. Browsing the
          Website confers the status of User and implies full and unreserved
          acceptance of all the provisions set out in this Legal Notice.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          The User undertakes to make correct use of the Website in accordance
          with the law, this Legal Notice, morality, good customs and public
          order.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink sm:text-3xl" style="font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 72;">
          3. Intellectual and industrial property
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          All the contents of the Website (texts, photographs, graphics,
          images, icons, technology, software, as well as its graphic design
          and source code) constitute a work whose ownership belongs to
          {' '}{legal.titular}. No exploitation rights over them are assigned to
          the User beyond what is strictly necessary for the correct use of the
          Website.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          The trademarks, trade names or distinctive signs are owned by
          {' '}{legal.titular} or third parties, and access to the Website may
          not be understood to grant any right over them.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink sm:text-3xl" style="font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 72;">
          4. Exclusion of warranties and liability
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          {legal.titular} shall not be liable, in any case, for damages of any
          nature that may be caused, by way of example: errors or omissions in
          the contents, lack of availability of the Website, or the
          transmission of viruses or malicious or harmful programs in the
          contents, despite having adopted all the technological measures
          necessary to prevent it.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink sm:text-3xl" style="font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 72;">
          5. Third-party links
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          The Website may contain links to third-party websites (among others,
          WhatsApp and Calendly). {legal.titular} exercises no control
          whatsoever over those sites and contents and shall under no
          circumstances assume any responsibility for the contents of any link
          belonging to a third-party website.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink sm:text-3xl" style="font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 72;">
          6. Applicable law and jurisdiction
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          The relationship between {legal.titular} and the User shall be
          governed by current Spanish law. For the resolution of any dispute,
          the parties submit to the Courts and Tribunals of the owner's domicile,
          unless the applicable law provides otherwise.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-ink sm:text-3xl" style="font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 72;">
          7. Modifications
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          {legal.titular} reserves the right to make, without prior notice, any
          modifications deemed appropriate to the Website, and may change,
          remove or add both the contents and services provided and the way in
          which they are presented or located.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-12 text-xs text-taupe">
      Last updated: {legal.fechaActualizacion}
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
